cloudtty is a FreeBSD console login and post-login menu replacement inspired
by the VMware ESXi Direct Console User Interface (DCUI).

It provides a full-screen, keyboard-first ratatui UI with:

  * CloudBSD Login modal (user dropdown, password, language selector)
  * Yellow/amber high-contrast framing suitable for VNC and serial consoles
  * OpenPAM authentication (administrator display name maps to root)
  * Host IPv4/IPv6 addresses in the header (excluding jail/VM interfaces)
  * Post-login menu for shell, system info, network, power actions

Font packages (spleen VT fonts, DejaVu mono, GNU Unifont) are declared as run
dependencies so supported locales (en-US, fr-FR) and broader Unicode text
render on the console path.

WWW: https://github.com/cloudbsd/cloudtty
